[metadata]
Name:Bolt Face
Goal:Cast a targeted spell, observe full bracket
Turns:2
Difficulty:Easy
Description:Cast Lightning Bolt at opponent. AILife=20 so the spell resolves and the game continues — the post-target-submit GSM bundle (TARGETS_CONFIRMED + RESOLVE content) is the whole point, and it gets short-circuited by autoPass.sendGameOver when the cast is lethal. Keep AILife high enough that the trace runs through all the cast-bracket frames.

